'You may prepare by **practicing** with sample topics, studying health policy issues and memorizing your format. You may not bring written templates; the format must be in your memory.',
'Treat the letter as a real communication to a real official. Respectful, honest and well-reasoned letters reflect well on you, your chapter and HOSA.',
